==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5~8 seconds<sup>150f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 14~17 seconds<sup>420f~510f</sup>.
*2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 25 seconds<sup>750f</sup>, delay 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Value Meal Cat (Enemy)|Value Meal Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 19.33~22 seconds<sup>580f~660f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 20~21.33 seconds<sup>600f~640f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**10 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 10~11.33 seconds<sup>300f~340f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The stage is pretty straightforward, just send a wall of [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] to stall the enemy or spam a lot of heavy hitters like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to finish the stage quickly. Even the boss isn't much of a threat.

